-# CALC-02, 2.10: the accepted calls and the average time from sending to acceptance.
%section#acceptance
  %h2 Acceptance time
  %table.data-table.compact
    %thead
      %tr
        %th Calls
        %th.numeric Accepted
        %th.numeric Average
    %tbody
      %tr
        %td{ data: { label: "Calls" } } All calls
        %td.numeric{ data: { label: "Accepted" } }= statistics.acceptances
        %td.numeric{ data: { label: "Average" } }= average_minutes(statistics.acceptance)
